                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "db176384-62e3-33d8-b932-35ae6b035a6d",
                        "entry_id": "4adc64da-95b6-3fb6-81c2-5a98bff4c97b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Boston (old card game)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "relational"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f9cb7ac-3717-4533-b121-5d46270a2b9f",
                                "sense_id": "db176384-62e3-33d8-b932-35ae6b035a6d",
                                "text": "Пьер, как оди́н из почётнейших госте́й, до́лжен был сесть в босто́н с Ильёй Андре́ичем, генера́лом и полко́вником. Пье́ру за босто́нным столо́м пришло́сь сиде́ть про́тив Ната́ши и стра́нная переме́на, происше́дшая в ней со дня ба́ла, порази́ла его́.",
                                "translation": "Pierre, as one of the principal guests, had to sit down to boston with Count Rostóv, the general, and the colonel. At the card table he happened to be directly facing Natásha, and was struck by a curious change that had come over her since the ball.",
                                "english": "Pierre, as one of the principal guests, had to sit down to boston with Count Rostóv, the general, and the colonel. At the card table he happened to be directly facing Natásha, and was struck by a curious change that had come over her since the ball."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
